e is currently in test mode: checkout uses test cards and Prodigi simulates fulfillment. No item will be manufactured or shipped.</p></details><details><summary>Shipping & care</summary><p>US addresses only. Standard shipping is $6 per order. Live delivery estimates will be added after sample testing. Wash inside out on cold, avoid bleach, and do not iron directly over the print.</p></details><details id=\"size-guide\"><summary>Find your fit</summary><p>Measure a tee you already love, laid flat. Chest is the full circumference in inches; length is shoulder to hem. Manufacturing tolerances apply.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Size</th><th>Chest</th><th>Length</th></tr></thead><tbody>{[['\"'S','36','28'],['M','40','29'],['L','44','30'],['XL','48','31'],['2XL','52','32']].map(r=><tr key={r[0]}>{r.map((c,i)=><td key={i}>{c}{i>0?'″':''}</td>)}</tr>)}</tbody></table><a href=\\\"https://www.prodigi.com/products/mens-clothing/t-shirts/classic/gildan-64000/\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer\\\">Manufacturer’s product details ↗</a></details></div></section>\n </main><footer><a href=\\\"/\\\" className=\\\"wordmark\\\">NIGHT SHIFT<span>✳</span></a><p>See you after sunset.</p><a href=\\\"/policies\\\">Shipping, returns & privacy ↗</a><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()} NIGHT SHIFT</span></footer>\n <dialog ref={bag} className=\\\"bag-dialog\\\" onCancel={()=>setShowBag(false)} onClose={()=>setShowBag(false)}><div className=\\\"bag-header\\\"><h2>Your bag <small>({count})</small></h2><button aria-label=\\\"Close bag\\\" onClick={()=>setShowBag(false)}>✕</button></div>{cart.length? <><div className=\\\"bag-items\\\">{cart.map((i,n)=><div className=\\\"bag-item\\\" key={i.id+i.size}><div className=\\\"bag-art\\\"><img src={\"'`/artwork/${i.id}-v1.svg`} alt=\"\" width=\"80\" height=\"100\"/></div><div><strong>{products.find(p=>p.id===i.id)!.name}</strong><p>Black / {i.size.toUpperCase()}</p><div className=\"quantity\"><button aria-label={`Decrease ${i.id} quantity`} onClick={(